# Sized for the 2 vCPU / 4Gi Container App default (loom-trino-aca.bicep).
# Heap is set explicitly rather than by RAM percentage so the container memory
# request in bicep and the JVM heap can never drift apart.
#
# Flags below are the upstream Trino defaults minus anything JDK-version
# sensitive — an invalid -XX flag makes the JVM refuse to start, which would
# turn a wired LOOM_TRINO_URL into a dead endpoint.
-server
-Xmx2G
-XX:+ExplicitGCInvokesConcurrent
-XX:+ExitOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:-OmitStackTraceInFastThrow
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=512M
-Djdk.attach.allowAttachSelf=true
-Dfile.encoding=UTF-8
